<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2CO- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">2 Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uamucivali ua Paulu kuli vaka Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua mucivali ua Paulu kuli vaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">KOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua Kolinte uamucivali vausonekele kuli kanganda Paulu ha miaka makumi atanu na miaka itanu na mukati ka miaka makumi atanu na miaka itanu na umo 55-56 hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu 1:1 Ou ukeuo mukanda uamucivali ku mikanda ivali ije ituli nayo ije Paulu uasonekelele ku cikungulukilo ca mu Kolinte. Vaka kulilongesa vatsiliela ngeci Paulu hanima uasonekele mukanda ua kutenuka kuli vaka Kolinte. Kutuesi na vimueso via mukanda ou uje uanamuesa mu 2:3-4 Kolinte uamucivali vausonekele tele Paulu ali mu Masendoniya 2:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua Kolinte uamucivali ukeo ualimanena muomu ukeo uapua mukanda uendi vavenia kaha uapua ua vusiua. Paulu amuesa nzolela yendi ha vimpande viacili vije viatambuile kuhuminina kuli Tito via cikungulukilo ca mu Kolinte. Mu mukanda ou mukemo tuuana vilongesa via kushula via kuhana viamu Litavasano Lialiha, ha mutambela uje Paulu ahana vishika via kutambula vimbongo vije vivanapande kutuala mukukuasa vaka kutsiliela vamu Yelusalema 8; 9 Cimuesa ngeci vamo tunganda vamakuli vaje keti vamu cikungulukilo vakele nakulikuasesa nzanzu ya vantu vamo vamu cikungulukilo mukuluisa Paulu ngeci valijundule vakevo vavenia. Vakele nakulikanouela ha nzili yakama ya Paulu, ije yalingisile ngeci akole ngoo mu nzili yendi yakama ya vunganda vua Yesu Kilistu hakumanusuila ca Kolinte uamucivali.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu aputuka mukanda uendi mukumeneka cikungulukilo 1:1-7</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako Paulu ahandeka muje muatenguluilile viyongola via vungenzi vuendi na vimpande viavo vije viatambuile na cikumbululo cavo cije civakumbuluile ha mukanda uendi uakulivanga 1:8; 7:16</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hanima yevi, Paulu ahana vishika viaha kutambula vimbongo via vaka kutsiliela vamu Yelusalema 8:1; 9:15</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Cakumanusuila, Paulu ahana kuluila ca vunganda vuendi na kuhana vinangulo via kumeneka cendi camucivali 10:1; 13:10</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Yange Paulu uje ivasanene ku cizango ca Njambi kupua kanganda ua Kilistu Yesu, njili na muanetu Timateo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Tulina kusonekela ku cikungulukilo ca Njambi cije cili ku Kolinte, naku vantu vakulela va Njambi voshe vaje vali mu Akaya muoshe.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Kavumbi na ciyulo vikale kuli yeni vije vihuminina kuli Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu atsantsela kuli Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Tushangazala Njambi Ishe ya Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, Tate ua cikeketima, ikeye Njambi kuje kukahumu kuzembeleka coshe! <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Ikeye muka kutuzembeleka mu tuyando tuetu tuoshe, ngeci netu linga tuase kuzembeleka vaje vali mu tuyando tuakuliseza seza, na kuzembeleka cije catuzembelekele naco yetu ca kuhuminina kuli Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ngue muje mutukalipangela mu vuingi mu tuyando tua Kilistu, mukemuo vene naua tuli nakulipangela mu vuingi mu kuzembeleka ca Kilistu. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Nga tuyanda, tuyandela kuzembeleka na kuovoka ceni, cipue nga vatuzembeleka kaha neni naua vamizembeleke, kuzembeleka cije ciminehela lukakateya na kusimpa mu tuyando tuakulifua tuje tutuli nakuyanda netu naua. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Nankuma, kutsiliela cetu muli yeni cakolo, muomu tuazivuka nguetu ngue muje mutuli nakulipangela hamo mu tuyando tuetu, mukemuo naua vene mutukalipangela hamo mukuzembeleka cetu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Vamuanetu muomu kututondo linga mukale kunzimba ha tuyando tuje tuahitilemo tele tuli mu Asiya. Muomu tuakele mulamba cikuma, ngeci kutuakele nakutsiliela nguetu tukayoya naua. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Tuayonguele nguetu kutsa vene vacihakele hali yetu, vuno honi eci calingiuile ngeci keti tulitsiliele yetu vavenia, vuno honi kuvanga kuli Njambi lika uje muka kusangula vatsi. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Uatuhumisile mu vushonde vuakama vua kutsa, kaha akatuovola, hali ikeye tunahaka kutsiliela cetu ngeci akatuovola naua. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Neni naua munapande kutukuasa na malombelo eni ngue muje muli nakutukuasa ha malombelo eni akutulombelela, linga vavengi vakahane citsantsela muomu yetu na muomu ya cikuisulo civatuhanene yetu cinapu cikumbululo ku malombelo amengi.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu atengulula matumbe endi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Muomu kulihalesa cetu cikeco eci, vukaleho vua visinganieka vietu via kuyoya cetu hano ha mavu, kaha cikuma vene na hali yeni, nakulela na vusunga vuakuhuma kuli Njambi keti na mana a vuntu houe, vuno honi na kavumbi kakuhuma kuli Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Muomu tukamisonekela lika vije vimuasa kutanda na kuvuisisa. Kaha njitsiliela ngeci mukevuisisa mukushula. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Ngue muje mumunovuile ku vimo, ngeci munapande kulihalesa muomu yetu kaha netu naua tulihalesa muomu yeni ha litangua lije lia Muene uetu Yesu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Muomu cilivene njavizivukile viuma evi, njatondele kuija kuli yeni ha kulivanga linga ngeci muvuahelele luvali. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Njatondele kumimenekela ha vungenzi vuange vuakuya ku Masendoniya, kaha naua nahakuhilukamo kuhuma ku Masendoniya, ngeci njiuane ngila yakunjikuasa ha vungenzi vuange vuakuya ku Yundeya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Omo njatondele kulinga eci, nkuma njakele na mitima ivali ndi? Cipue nkuma njikalingi matumbe ange ngue vaka mavu vaje valivuahesela kuhandeka nguavo “Eyo,” na “Houe,” ha ntsimbu imolika ndi? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Ngue muje cilivene Njambi uapua uakulongua, lizi lietu kuli yeni kuliapuile, “Eyo” na “Houe.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Muomu Yesu Kilistu Muna Njambi, uje ituambuluile hakati keni, kuli yange na Silase na Timateo, kapuile “Eyo” na “Houe” vuno honi muli ikeye ntsimbu yoshe muakala lika “Eyo,” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Muomu vikulaheso vioshe via Njambi vikauana “Eyo” yavio muli ikeye. Muomu ha cuma eci mukemo tukahandeka “Ameni,” kuhitila muli ikeye ku vumpau vua Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Vuno honi Njambi ikeye akatukolesa ngoo muli Kilistu, na kutuvuavesa yetu. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Nahaka kapateso kendi hali yetu, na kutuhana Cimbembesi cendi mu mitima yetu kupua ngue vikulaheso vije vianatutulikila kulutue.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Vuno honi njitumbula Njambi kupua mukaleho uange, azivuka mutima uange! Mu ngila ya kumitetela njayonguele ngeci keti njiye ku Kolinte. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Keti ngue tuli nakumisindiya vije vimunapande kutsiliela houe, tulina kupanga hamo neni muomu yanzolela yeni, muomu yeni munemana ngoo mu lutsilielo lueni.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Muomu, njayonguele mu mutima uange nguange kunjikejaho naua kuli yeni nakumivuisa kupihia ku mitima. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Muomu nga njikamiuvuisa kupihia, kaha iya naua akanjivuisa kuvuahelela nkuma keti yeni vene vaje vanjinovuisa kupihia ndi? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Kaha njasonekele ngue muje vene munjasonekelelemo, linga omo njikeja keti njikakale mulamba kuli vaje vanapande kunjivuahelesa, muomu njamitsiliela yeni voshe, ngeci nzolela yange ikeyo vene nzolela yeni muva voshe. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Njamisonekelele nakupihilila cakama cikuma na kulinienga mu mutima na misozi yaingi, ngeci keti njimipihise ku mutima, vuno honi linga muzivuke cizango cakama cije cinjakala naco hali yeni.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukonekela muka kuvulumuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Vuno honi nga umo na vulumuina mukuavo, kavulumuinine cikuma yange ngue muje muanavulumuina yeni voshe, muomu kunjatondele ngeci njipue uamukalu kuli ikeye. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Muomu eci cinapumo kuli muntu uje ivanahana kashitiko ku vantu voshe vavengi. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Kaha naua cipue ngocovene munapande kumukonekela na kumuzembeleka, keti ngoconi akakala na vusiua cikuma. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Nankuma njimilomba nguange mu mumuese cilivene nkuma muamuzanga. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Muomu eci cikeco canehesele linga njisoneke uje mukanda, ngeci njase kumieseka na kumona nga yeni muononoka mu vioshe. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Muntu uoshe uje imukonekela nange naua njimukonekela, kaha vije vinjinakonekela, nga njakonekela vioshe kaha cinapu muomu yeni ku mesho a Kilistu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />linga Satana keti atuhiane, muomu yetu kutuesi kunzimba namatumbe endi.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulishoshomuena ca Paulu mu Tolouase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Omo njayile ku Tolouase na kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu, vanjishokoluelele cikolo kuli Muene. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Vuno honi njaliniengele cikuma omo kunjauanene muanetu Tito kuje. Nankuma njavasezele, nakutualelelaho kuya ku Masendoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiana kuhitila muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Vuno honi njitsantsela kuli Njambi, muomu muli Kilistu ntsimbu yoshe ikeye natutuamenena ngue vinzinda vakuhiana muli Kilistu. Njambi akatupangesa mukulingisa Kilistu ashandoke ngue luengo luacili luakumuzivuka kuoshe kuoshe. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Muomu tuapua ngue luengo luacili lua Kilistu kuli Njambi hakati kavaje vali na kuovoka na hakati kavaje vali nakunonga. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kaha kuli vamo napu luengo luakuhuma kukutsa nakuya kukutsa, kaha kuveka napu luengo lua kuhuma ku muono nakuya ku muono. Nkuma iya honi napuisamo ha viuma evi? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Muomu kutuafuile ngue vaje vakalandesa lizi lia Njambi, vuno honi ngue vamala va vusunga vaje vavanatumu kuli Njambi, ku mesho a Njambi tuhandeka muli Kilistu.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Vangamba va Litavasono Lialiha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Nkuma tuaputuka kulizumboka yetu vavenia naua ndi? Cipue nkuma yetu tunapande kulinga ngue muje mu vakalingi veka, kukala na mikanda ya vukaleho vuetu kuli yeni cipue yakuhuma kuli yeni ndi? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Yeni vene vavenia munapu mukanda uetu uavukaleho, uje vanasoneka mu mitima yeni linga vauzivuke na kuutanda ku vantu voshe. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Kaha yeni mumuesa ngeci munapu mukanda uakuhuma kuli Kilistu uje utunaneha yetu. Uje keti uakusoneka na tinta, vuno honi na Cimbembesi ua Njambi uakuyoya, keti uakusoneka ha vitale via mavue vuno honi ha vitale via mitima ya vantu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Eci cikeco kusimpa cije tuli naco kuhitila muli Kilistu hali Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Keti ngue nguavo yetu vavenia tuasa kulinga cili coshe cije cija kuli yetu vuno honi vioshe vije vituasa kulinga vikahuminina kuli Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ikeye na tuasesa kupua vangamba valitavasano lia lihia, lije keti liakusoneka, vuno honi lia mu cimbembesi. Muomu liakusoneka lineha kutsa, vuno honi lia Cimbembesi lineha muono.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Honi nga vije vipangi vianehele kutsa vavicokuele mu visona ha livue, kaha viezile na vumpau vuangacije ngeci vaka Isaleli kuvasele kutala ku cihanga ca Mosesa muomu ya kuviakula cipue vene cikeco capuile cakutsitsivala. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Nkuma vipangi via Cimbembesi kuvikapu via vumpau cikuma kuma ndi? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Muomu nga kuakele vumpau mu vipangi vije vianehele cihiso. Kaha vipangi vije via vusunga vinapande kuvipulakana cikuma ku vumpau. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Cilivene ha cuma eci, cije cakeleho na vumpau kucesiho naua na vumpau, muomu ya vumpau vuje vua cihiana. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Muomu nga vije viatsitsivalele viezile na vumpau kaha vukahiana vati vumpau vuje vua viuma vije kuviekuhua.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Nankuma tulina kutsiliela eci, kaha tunasimpi cikuma. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Yetu kutuapuile ngue Mosesa uje uafuikile lilesu ku cihanga cendi ngeci vantu Vaisaleli keti vamone vumpau vuje vuakele nakutsitsivala. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Vuno honi mana avo va akolesele, muomu kuneha na ku litangua lino omo nga vatanda litavasano lia laja, lije lilesu lia kulifua hangavene liakala liakuhona kufukula muomu kuvanga lika kuhitila muli Kilistu amba lihume. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Eyo, nakuneha na ku litangua lino ntsimbu yoshe nga vatanda Lishiko lia Mosesa, kaha lije lilesu lifuika mana avo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Vuno honi muomu muntu nga atengulukila kuli Muene kaha lije lilesu vana lihumisa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Honi Muene ikeye Cimbembesi kaha kuje kuli Cimbembesi ua Muene kukeko kuli kupatuka. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Kaha yetu voshe na vihanga via kuhona kufukula lilesu vaje vamuesa vumpau vua Muene vanatuhimpula mucifua cendi kuhuma haseteko imo ya vumpau nakuya haseteko yeka, muomu eci cihuminina kuli Muene ikeye vene Cimbembesi.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Vufuko vua Cimbembesi vua mu vindeho via Vuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nankuma, muomu ya kuhitila mu cikeketima ca Njambi ngeci tuli na vipangi evi, kaha keti tuzeye. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Tunaviana viuma via vushueke via shuamua, kutue kupangesa makuli kaha naua kutue kuhandeka lizi lia Njambi mu makuli. Vuno honi hakuhandeka vusunga tulizumboka yetu vavenia ku mana a muntu uoshe ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Kaha cipue vene nga Muzimbu Uacili uetu vanaushueke, kaha vanaushuekela lika kuli vaje vanonga. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Kuli vakevoni njambi ua mavu aua napuisa mana a vaje vaka kuhona kutsiliela vupuputua linga keti vamone ceke ca Muzimbu Uacili ua vumpau vua Kilistu, ikeye uje cifua ca Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Muomu vije vitukambulula kutue kuliambuluila yetu vavenia, vuno honi Yesu Kilistu hakupua Muene, kaha netu naua tunapu vangamba veni muomu ya Yesu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Muomu Njambi ikeye vene uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni ceke citue ha milima,” Njambi ikeye vene uatuililile mu mitima yetu mukutuhana ceke ca mana a vumpau vua Njambi ku mesho a Kilistu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Vuno honi tuli na vufuko ovu mu vindeho via vuma mukumuesa ngeci nzili yakama yakala kuli Njambi keti kuli yetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Tukakala mu vukalu mu vingila via kuli seza seza, vuno honi ku ekutuhiana, akatukuomouesa vuno honi ku ekutumanusula kutsiliela coshe. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Vakatupakesa vuno honi kekutuseza, vaka tuvulumuina vuno honi kuve kutunongesa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ha vintsimbu vioshe tukambata kutsa ca Yesu mu mivila yetu, linga muono ua Yesu vaumone mu mivila yetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Muomu tuyoya ntsimbu yoshe tuli mu makalu akutsa muomu ya Yesu, linga muono ua Yesu ulimuese mu mivila yetu, ije yasa kutsa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Nankuma kutsa cili nakupanga muli yetu, vuno honi muono uli na kupanga muli yeni.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Nankuma muomu tuli na Cimbembesi ca kulifua ca lutsilielo ngue muje muakala naco uje uasonekele nguendi, “Njatsilielele kaha njahandekele,” Netu naua tutsiliela ngeci tukahandeka. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ha kuzivuka ngeci uje uasanguile Muene Yesu akatusangula netu naua hamo na Yesu nakutuneha yetu hamo neni ku mesho endi. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Vioshe evi vinapu muomu yeni, linga kavumbi kahete ku vantu vavengi cikuma ngeci kavuezelele kuhana kutsantsela ku vumpau vua Njambi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyoya ha Lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Nankuma keti tuhonoue. Cipue vene oku muvila uetu uahambaza uli na kuzeya vuno honi muvila uetu uamu ntima vali nakuulinga vuha ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Muomu tuyando otu tua ntsimbu yaindende tuli nakulingisa yetu kulivuahesela kutambula kavumbi kayaye kaje kakama cikuma kupulakana tuyando tuje. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Muomu yetu kutue kuyongola viuma vije vivamona vuno honi viuma vije kuvekumona, muomu viuma vije vivamona viapua via kantsimbu lika vuno honi viuma vije kuvamono viapua via yaye.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Limbo lietu lia Muilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Muomu tuzivuka nguetu, nga mbalaka ya hano ha mavu ije ituakalamo vainongesa tuli na njivo kuli Njambi, njivo ije keti yakutunga na mavoko vuno honi ya yaye muilu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Hano cilivene tuli nakulikemanga, kaha tushunguiya cikuma Njambi linga atuzike muvila uje ukapua ngue njivo yetu ya muilu. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Linga haku uzala kaha keti tukakale vuntselentsele. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Muomu tucili na kuyoyela mu mbalaka eyi, tulina kulikemanga na tuyando, keti ngue nguavo tutonda linga vatuhumise muvila ou uaka ntsimbu lika, vuno honi linga hanga vene vatuzikeuo ngeci uje muvila uakutsa vaumine ku muono. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Uje natuvuahesela cuma eci ikeye vene Njambi uje natuhana Cimbembesi kupua fueto ya kushulisisa cikulaheso.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Nankuma ntsimbu yoshe tunasimpi cikuma. Tuazivuka nguetu muomu tucili kuimbo mu muvila kaha tuli kulahako na Muene. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Muomu tukende na lutsilielo keti na mesho. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Tuasimpi cikuma kaha tuasa kuhuma mu muvila ou nakuya kuimbo kuli Muene. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Nankuma cipue tuli kuimbo indi tuvahiko, vitukatondoni kumuvuahelesa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Muomu tuva voshe tunapande kusholoka ku cituamo ca kusompa ca Kilistu, linga umo na umo atambule vucili cipue vupi kuya ku vije vianapanga mu muvila.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vusamba na Njambi kuhitila muli Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nankuma, muomu ya kuzivuka kuvuila Muene liova, tusindiya vantu vuno honi Njambi ikeye azivuka muje mutuafua kaha njatsiliela nguange neni vene naua muacizivuka mu mana eni. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Kutuesi nakulizumbuoka yetu vavenia kuli yeni naua vuno honi kumihana cije cilingisa ngeci mulihalese muomu yetu, linga neni cimiasiuise kukumbulula vaje vali na kulihalesa vakevo vavenia ku mesho a vantu keti ngue ha vilinga viavo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Muomu nga yetu kutuesi nakusinganieka muacili, kaha cinapu muomu ya Njambi. Nga naua tusinganieka muacili kaha cinapu muomu yeni. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Muomu cizango ca Kilistu cikeco cikatuendesa, cilivene tuzivuka nguetu umo uatsililile voshe. Nankuma voshe vanatsi. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Kaha uatsililile voshe, linga voshe vaje vayoya keti valiyoyele vakevo vavenia vuno honi hali ikeye uje muomu yavo ngeci uatsile kaha vamusanguile. <verse eid="2CO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Nankuma hume hano honi, kutukambata muntu uoshe kuya ku cifua ca vuntu, cipuevene nguavo ntsimbu imo tuambatele Kilistu mu cifua ca vuntu, vuno honi kutuka muambatamo naua. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Nankuma, nga kuli umo uje ali muli Kilistu, kaha napu kutanga ca ciha. Kaha via laja vinahiti, taleni, viavihia vineja. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Vioshe evi vihuma kuli Njambi, uje kuhitila muli Kilistu uatukonekelele linga tuije kuli ikeye kaha uatuhanene cipangi ca kulikonekela umo na mukuovo. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Kaha kuhitila muli Kilistu, Njambi uakonekelele mavu naku aneha kuli ikeye vavenia cakuhona kutanda milonga yavo ije yakuvaluisa nayo kaha nakundika kuli yetu muzimbu uakulikonekela umo na mukuavo.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Nankuma, yetu tunapu vaka kuimanena Kilistu, Njambi alina kumilania kuhitila muli yetu. Tumilambelela hali Kilistu, likonekeleni kuli Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kaha muomu yetu, Njambi uamupuisile muka vupi uje kazivukile vupi, linga kuhitila muli ikeye ngeci tupue vaka vusunga kuli Njambi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Hakupua vaka kupangela hamo na Njambi, tumilambelela nguetu keti mutambule kavumbi ka Njambi nakukecela linga kaye muangoco. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Muomu Njambi nahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Ntsimbu yacili yahetele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">njamivuililile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">kaha njamikuasele ha litangua lia kuovoka.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Taleni, honi ntsimbu yacili ino, kaha taleni naua litangua lia kuovoka lino.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Kaha tuli na kueseka linga keti tuhake citsuntsuiso mu ngila ya muntu uoshe, ngeci keti vakauane mulonga na vipangi vietu. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Vuno honi hakupua vangamba va Njambi tulihana yetu vavenia mu vioshe kuhitila mu lukakateya luakama, na mu tuyando, na mu lamba, na mu vitanga, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />na mu vipumpu, na mu tumenga, na mu kulua, na mu kuhundangana, na mu cilavu lavu, na mu njala, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />na mu kulela, na mu mana, na mu kusimpa, na mu ngozi, na mu Cimbembesi Uakulela, na mu cizango ca vusunga, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />na mu kuhandeka ca vusunga, na mu nzili ya Njambi, na mu vitua via vusunga via ku livoko lia cilio na lia cimoshue. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Mu kasingimiko na mukuhona kasingimiko, mukutushaula na muku tushangazala. Vali nakutuambata ngue tuvaka makuli vuno honi tuvaka vusunga, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />ngue vaje kuvatuzivuka, vuno honi vatuzivuka, ngue vaje vanatsi, kaha taleni tuyoya ngue vaje vali hakashitiko, vuno honi kanda vavatsihe, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />ngue vaje vali mu vusiua, vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe tujolela, ngue vihutu, vuno honi tukapuisa vantu vavengi kupua vaka kufuka, ngue vaje kuvesi nacimo, vuno honi tuli navioshe.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Tunahandeka muavusunga kuli yeni vaka Kolinte, tunashokolola mitima yetu kuli yeni. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Kutuesi nakuvindika cizango cetu kuli yeni, vuno honi yeni muli nakuvindika cizango ceni kuli yetu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Kaha muomu yeci, njihandeka kuli yeni ngue vana vange, shokololeni mitima yeni neni naua.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo caha kushongangeya ca vaka kuhona kutsiliela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Keti mupangele hamo na vaje vaka kuhona kutsiliela. Muomu nkuma vusamba muka vuliho hali vaka vusunga na vaje vaka kuhona kutsiliela? Cipue nkuma vumo muka vuli ha ceke na milima? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Nkuma vumo muka vuliho hali Kilistu na Liyavolo? Cipue nkuma kulifua muka ciliho hali vaka kutsiliela na vaka kuhona kutsiliela? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Nkuma Njivo ya Njambi ili na litavasano muka na tumponia? Muomu yetu tunapu Njivo ya Njambi, Njambi ua kuyoya, ngue muje muahandekele Njambi nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Njikakala muli vakevo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">nakuenda hakati kavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">kaha njikapua Njambi yavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">kaha navo vakapua vantu vange.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Kaha Muene uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Humeni muli vakevo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">kaha litepeni navo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Kaha keti mukuate via kuhona kulela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ambahoni njikamitambula.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Njikapua nji Ishueni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">kaha mukapua vana vange va vamala na va vampuevo.” Evi vikevio vianahandeka Muene Uanzili yoshe.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Nankuma vamuanetu, omo tuli na vikulaheso evi tuyeni tulilelese yetu vavenia ku vioshe vije vijualesa muvila na Cimbembesi. Kaha tuyeni tulilelese muavusunga muomu yakuvuila Njambi liova.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvuahelela ca Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Tushokolueleni mitima yeni, naumo uahi utunapihisila, kaha naumo uahi utunazimbalesa lutsilielo luendi kaha naumo uahi naua utunakuisa. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Kunjesi nakuhandeka evi mu kumisompa, ngue muje munjahandekele ha kulivanga nguange muli mu mitima yetu, tukatsa hamo na kuyoya hamo. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Njili na lutsilielo luakama muli yeni, njili nakulihalesa cikuma muli yeni, kaha njashulu na kusimpa na mu tuyando tuetu tuoshe njili na nzolela yakama.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Muomu cipuevene tuezile mu Masendoniya mivila yetu kuyahuimine vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe tuakele mulamba nakulua na veka kaha naliova muli yetu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Vuno honi Njambi uje muka kusimpisa vaje vanazeye, uatusimpisile mukuija ca Tito, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />kaha keti lika hakuija cendi vuno honi naua nakusimpa cije civamusimpisile muli yeni ngue muje muatulekele cishota mitima ceni, nakulila ceni, na cizango ceni cakama cikuma hali yange linga nzolela yange ipue yakama cikuma.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Muomu cipuevene njamivuisile vusiua na mukanda uange, kunjalipayele (cipuevene nguavo njalipayele), muomu njamuene ngeci uje mukanda uamiuvuisile vusiua cipuevene capuile mu kantsimbu lika. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ngue muje mucinafu njivuahelela, keti ngue nguavo muomu muakele na vusiua vuno honi muomu vusiua vueni vuapuile vua kutenguluka ku vupi vueni muomu muovuile vusiua vua vunjambi, kaha kumuayandele muangoco hamo yetu. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Muomu vusiua vua vunjambi vukanehe kutenguluka cije cituala kukuovoka kaha kucekuneha kulipaya, vuno honi vusiua vua mavu vukanehe kutsa. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Muomu taleni vusunga vua vusiua vua vunjambi vuje vivunaneha muli yeni, cilivene muje muvunamuesa vusunga vueni, taleni vutenu vuje vuasholokele, kulikomokela eci, cishota mutima eci, na cizango cakama eci, na kashitiko kakama aka. Mu vintsimbu vioshe mualimuesa yeni vavenia ngeci kumuesi na mulonga mu cuma eci.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Nankuma cipue vene njamisonekelele mukanda, kuuapuile ya mulonga ua umo uje ualingile vupi cipue ha mulonga ua umo uje uayandele muomu ya vupi, vuno honi linga cizango ceni cakama hali yetu cisholoke kuli yeni ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Nankuma vatuzembeleka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Kaha muku tuzembeleka cetu tuavuahelele cikuma muomu ya nzolela ya Tito, muomu mana endi anahuimi muomu yeni. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Njalihalesele kuli ikeye muomu yeni, kunjevuile shuamua vuno honi muomu ngue muje vene vioshe vije vituahandekele kuli yeni viapuile via vusunga, nankuma kulihalesa cetu kuli Tito capuile ca vusunga. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kaha cizango cendi hali yeni capua cakama cikuma muomu nga avuluka kuononoka ceni voshe, na liova nakujaja cije cimuamutambuile naco. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Njivuahelela muomu njili na lutsilielo lua kusimpa muli yeni.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuhana ca vuka Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Vamuanetu tutonda linga muzivuke, ha kavumbi ka Njambi kaje kavanamuesa mu vikungulukilo via Masendoniya, <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />muomu cipuevene vakele muvieseko viakama, vuno honi nzolela yavo yapuile yakama ngeci vakele nakuhana na mutima umo oku cipuevene vapuile vihutu cikuma. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Muomu vakele nakuhana muvaselelemo muoshe, ngue muje munjicambuluilamo, vakele nakuhana kupulakana muvije vivakele navio. Kuya ku cizango cavo, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />vakele nakutulambelela linga tulipandakane mukulinga cipangi eci cakukuasa vantu vakulela va Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Omu keti mukemo mutua yonguelelemo, vuno honi ha kulivanga valihanene vakevo vavenia kuli Muene nakuli yetu ku cizango ca Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Nankuma tuananguile Tito muomu ikeye hakupua uje uaputukile laja, napande kumanusula naua na hakati keni cipangi eci ca kavumbi. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Honi ngue muje mu mulina kutualelelaho kukala muacili mu lutsilielo, na mukuhandeka, namu mana, na mu vusunga vuoshe, na mu cizango ceni hali yetu, taleni tutonda naua nguetu mutualeleho kulinga muacili namu cipangi eci ca kavumbi naua.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Njilinakuhandeka eci keti ngue cishika, vuno honi kushulisisa kukolesa ca vakueni ngeci na cizango ceni naua capua ca vusunga. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Muomu muazivuka kavumbi ka Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu, ngeci cipuevene ikeye uapuile muka kufuka, vuno honi muomu yeni uapuile cihutu, ngeci ya kuhutua cendi linga mupue vaka kufuka.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Kaha ha cuma eci njihana visinganieka viange, cacili kuli yeni hano vene kumanusula vije vimuaputukile muaka uali, vije keti lika vimualingile vuno honi muavilingile muomu muatondele kuvilinga, <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />ngeci kulivuahesela ceni mukucishunguiya hamo vacipuisa mumo nakucimanesa na vije muli navio. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Muomu nga kulivuahesela kucili, kaha vanacitambula kuya ku vije muntu ali navio, keti ngue kuya ku vije muntu kesi navio.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Kunjesi nakulumbununa nguange vakueni vavehuise kaha yeni mukale na citeli, <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />vuno honi yeni muomu muli na viavingi ha ntsimbu ino, cinapu cacili ngeci munapande kukuasa vaje vanajena. Ambahoni, omo neni naua mukajena kaha vaje vali na viavingi, kaha navo naua vakamikuasa. Mu ngila eyi vene muva voshe vanamipuisa hamo. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Ngue muje muvanacisoneka nguavo, “Uje uakunguluile viavingi kesi na cimo cahi, kaha uje uakunguluile viavindende kajenene.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito na vakuavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Vuno honi kutsantsela cikale kuli Njambi uje akahaka kushungozola cakama cakulifua hali yeni mu mutima ua Tito. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Muomu ikeye katambuile lika kulomba cetu, vuno honi uakolesele mukumikuasa mu cizango cendi vavenia ngeci akeja kuli yeni. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Tulina kutuma hamo nendi muanetu uje uakutsimana hakati ka vikungulukilo vioshe muomu ya kuambulula cendi ca Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kaha keti evi lika, vuno honi vana muhangula ku vaka vikungulukilo linga ende netu mu vipangi evi via kavumbi vije vituli nakulinga, muomu ya vumpau vua Muene nakumuesa vucili vuetu.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Tulina kulinga muacili ngeci keti kukakale umo akatupaye ha vuana ovu vuacili vuje vutuli nakulinga. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Muomu tutonda kulinga lika viakasingimiko, keti lika ku mesho a Muene vuno honi naua naku mesho a vantu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Kaha tulina kutuma vakevo na muanetu uje ituneseka lualuingi kaha tunamuuana kupua ualukakateya mu viuma vioshe, vuno honi uapua uakulongua cikuma kupulakana laja muomu ya kutsiliela cendi cakama muli yeni. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Kaha hali Tito ni, napu mukuasi na muanetu mutukapangela mu vipangi vieni, kaha hali vamuanetu ni, vanapu tunganda va vikungulukilo, na vumpau vua Kilistu. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nankuma mueseni ava vantu vukaleho vua cizango ceni na vika vije yetu tukalihalesela muli yeni, linga vikungulukilo vavimone.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kukuasa vaka kutsiliela vakujena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Honi kucesi na seho naua yange kumisonekela ha vukuasi vua vantu vakulela va Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Muomu njazivuka ngeci muakala na cizango cakukuasa, cije cinjikalihalesela muomu yeni ku vantu vamu Masendoniya, njikahandeka nguange vaka Akaya vanalivuahesela vualumo hume muakauali kukuasa, kaha cizango ceni cinakolesa vavengi vavo. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Vuno honi njilina kutuma vamuanetu linga kulihalesa cetu hali yeni ha cuma eci keti ciye muangoco, linga mulivuahesele vualumo, ngue muje munjahandekele nguange mulinge. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Keti ngoconi, hamo nga vaka Masendoniya vamo veja nange kaha nakuuana nguavo yeni kumualivuaheselele vualumo, kaha tukevua shuamua, nacimo cahi vakahandeka hali yeni muomu vamitsiliela laja. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Nankuma, njacisinganiekele ngeci cinapande kutuma vamuanetu linga valivange kuija kuli yeni ntsimbu kanda yange njihete, linga mulivuahesela vualumo vuana vuje vumuakulahesele, cimuese ngeci mulinakuhana muomu mutonda kucilinga keti ngue valina kumisindiya.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Anukeni eci ngeci uoshe uje akuna viavindende akateja naua viavindende, kaha uoshe uje akuna viavingi akateja naua viavingi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Umo na umo ueni napande kuhana vije vianasinganieka mu mutima uendi ku vihana, keti oku ulinienga, cipue ngue vanakusindiya, muomu Njambi uazanga uje muka kuhana na mutima umo. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Kaha Njambi asa kukuhana cikuisulo coshe mu vuingi, linga ntsimbu yoshe ukale na viavingi kaha naua uase kukala na viavingi muvuingi, viakulikuasesa ku vipangi viacili. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Ngue muvana cisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Akahana voshe vaje vanajena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">vusunga vuendi vuapua vuayaye.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Kaha uje muka kuhana mbuto kuli ndimi na mbolo kupua cakulia, akamihana na kuvuezelela viuma vieni nakuvuezelela kuteja ca vusunga. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Mukafuka mu vingila vioshe linga mukale na ngozi yakuhana cikuma vintsimbu vioshe, kaha kuhitila muli yetu ngozi yeni ikapua citsantsela kuli Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Muomu cipangi eci cimuli nakupanga keti lika cakukuasa vantu vakulela va Njambi vaje vanajena vuno honi naua cinapu kuneha kushula mu vitsantsela viavingi kuli Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Muomu ya cipangi cije munamuesa yeni vavenia, vavengi vakalemesa Njambi ha kuononoka cije cinalipandakana nakuambulula ceni ca Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu, kaha muomu ya ngozi yeni mukulipangela navo na veka voshe. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Kaha mu malombelo avo hali yeni, vakashoto mitima yavo muomu ya kavumbi kakama kaje kanamihana Njambi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tutsantseleni Njambi muomu ya vuana vuendi vuje kutuasa kulumbununa!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulu aluila vipangi viendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Yange Paulu, njimilambelela nakulikehesa na kulionuenesa ca Kilistu, yange uje uakulikehesa omo njilineni, vuno honi njiuakukaluua kuli yeni nga kunjesi hamo neni. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Njimilambelela ngeci omo njija hamo kunjikamuesa kukaluua ngue munjitondelamo ku vantu vamo vaje vasinganieka nguavo tuayoya mu futisi ya mavu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Muomu cipue vene tuayoya ha mavu, vuno honi yetu kutuekulua nzita ngue muje muvakalingilamo vaka mavu, <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />muomu vitua vije vitukalu navio keti via hano ha mavu vuno honi vikevo vili na nzili ya Njambi ije yasa kunongesa vinganda. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Tukanongesa vimpata na cakutanganesa coshe cije cakulihalesa cije ciluisa mana a Njambi, kaha tukalingi viyongola vioshe kupua vunzinda linga viononoke Kilistu. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Kaha tukalivuahesela vualumo kuhana kashitiko ku vilinga vioshe vije viakuhona kuononoka, omo nga yeni munapuisamo kuononoka ceni.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Yeni mukamono lika muje viuma mu visholokelamo hambanza. Nga kuli vamo vakalitanda nguavo vapua vantu va Kilistu, kaha vanapande kusinganieka ngeci netu naua tuapua tuvaka Kilistu. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Muomu cipue vene nga njilihalesa cikuma ha nzili yakama ije Muene uahanene mukumitunga yeni kaha keti mukuminongesa, kunjika ivuila shuamua. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Kunjitondo cimuese ngeci njilinakumiteuesa na mikanda yange. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Muomu vamo vahandeka nguavo, “Mikanda yendi yapua yakulema nakukola, vuno honi muvila uendi uapua uakuzeya, kaha navihandeka viendi viapua viakuhona seho.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Vantu ava vanapande kuzivuka ngeci vije vitukahandeka mu mikanda omo tuvahiko, vikevio tukalingi omo kutuli.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kutuekutonda kulijundula cipue kulisetekesa yetu vavenia navamo vaje vakalijundula vakevo vavenia. Vuno honi omo nga valieseka vakevo vavenia ku umo na mukuavo, vakahandeka nguavo vakevo vapua vacili. Kaha valiseteka vakevo vavenia cakuhona kuvuisisa. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Kutukalihalesa mukupulakana, vuno honi kulihalesa cetu cikapuamo kuya muje Njambi natuhanenamo, eci cipandakana vene na vipangi vije vitunalingi kuli yeni. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Muomu kutuesi na kutualelelaho kulihalesa cetu ngue yetu kutuezile kuli yeni, yetu tuapuile vakulivanga kuhuma kulahako nakuminehela Muzimbu Uacili ua Kilistu. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Kutukalihalesa kupulakana seteko yetu mu vipangi vije vivanalingi vakuetu veka, vuno honi kutsiliela cetu cinapu ngeci lutsilielo lueni linga lulivuezelele na vipangi vietu hakati keni linga vilivuezelele, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />ngeci tuase kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili keti kuli yeni lika vuno honi na mu vinganda vieka, kuakuhona kulihalesa ha vipangi vije vivanalingi laja vakuetu.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Vuno honi ngue muje muvihandeka visoneka kuavio, “Eceleni uoshe uje alihalesa, alihalesele hali Muene.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Muomu keti muntu uje alijundula ikeye vavenia ikeye uje ivakatambula, vuno honi muntu uje Muene akajundula.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paulu na tunganda vamakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Njishunguiya ngue munjitavesako kavundende kulinga vulema vuange. Njitaveseni. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Njilinakumiuvuila cipululu ca vunjambi, muomu njamikulahesa yeni kuli Kilistu mukumihana ngue shombolua ua vusunga kuli yaliendi umo lika. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Vuno honi njili nakuteua ngeci ngue muje linoka uakuisile Eva na kuzangama cendi ca makuli, kaha visinganieka vieni vikamituala kulahako nakuhona kuononoka Kilistu na vucili na kusungama. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Muomu nga muntu umo eja nakuambulula Yesu ueka kupulakana uje ituambuluile yetu, cipue nga mutambula cimbembesi ueka kupulakana uje imuatambuile, indi cipue nga mutambula muzimbu uacili ueka uakuliseza na uje umuatambuile, kaha mulihana kuli vikevio mukushula.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Njisinganieka ngeci kunjapuile njiuamundende kuli ava vavahandeka nguavo tunganda vakama cikuma. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Cipue vene nga keti njiuakulilongesa mukuhandeka muacili, vuno honi njili na mana mu vingila vioshe tunalumbununa evi muacili kuli yeni mu viuma vioshe.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Nkuma njalingile vupi mukulikehesa yange vavenia ngeci yeni vamijundule, muje munjambuluile Muzimbu Uacili ua Njambi cakuhona ndando kuli yeni ndi? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Njevililile vikungulukilo vieka hakutambula vukuasi kuli vakevo muomu yakumikuasa yeni. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Kaha muomu njakele neni nakutonda vimo, kunjahanene citeli kuli muntu uoshe muomu vukuasi vuange vuakele nakuhuma kuli muanetu uje uahumine ku Masendoniya. Nankuma njalikelele, kaha njikalikela naua kupua citeli kuli yeni mu vingila vioshe. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Kaha ngue ha vusunga vua Kilistu uje ali hali yange, eci kulihalesa cange ku vakaciholuesa kuluu mu vihela via Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Nkuma vika honi njihandekela eci? Muomu yange kunjamizangele ndi? Njambi azivuka ngeci njamizanga!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Kaha vije vinjikalingi njikavitualelelaho kuvilinga, ngeci njikahonouese vihandeka via vaje vakahandeka nguavo ku vipangi viavo viakulihalesa vakapanga hamo netu ngue muje mutukalingi. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Muomu vantu ava vapua tunganda va makuli, vaka kupanga va makuli vakalipuisa vakevo vavenia ngue tunganda va Kilistu. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Kutukomoka, ngeci cilivene cipue Satana ualipuisile ikeye vavenia ngue kangelo ua ceke. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Nankuma kucasa kupua ca kukomouesa nga vangamba vendi na vakevo naua valipuisa vakevo vavenia ngue vangamba va vusunga, mamanusuilo avo akalifua na vilinga viavo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyando tua Paulu ha kupua kanganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Njihilukilaho naua nguange, eceleni muntu uoshe keti asinganieke nguendi njicilema, vuno honi cipuevene nga mucisinganieka, kaha njitambuleni ngue vene cilema ngeci nange naua linga njikalihaleseko muvundende. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />(Vinjili nakuhandeka kunjesi nakuhandeka na nzili yakama ya Muene vuno honi ngue cilema mukulihalesa eci ca kusimpa, <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />nankuma muomu vavengi vakalihalesa na viuma via mavu, nange naua njikalihalesa) <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Muomu yeni muka litavasana muacili na vilema, hakupua yeni vavenia vakuzangama. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Muomu yeni mukacitava cipue vene nga muntu amilinga vundungo, cipue amikuisa, cipue amizangamena, cipue uje amikehesa, cipue uje amipupa mbanda ku cihanga. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Na shuamua yange, njihandeka nguange tuazeyele cikuma hali evi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Vuno honi vioshe vije muntu atonda linga alihalesele, njilinakuhandeka ngue cilema, nange naua njinapande kulihaleselaco. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Nkuma vanapu Vahevelu ndi? Kaha nange vene nji Kahevelu. Nkuma vanapu Vaisaleli ndi? Kaha nange vene nji Kaisaleli, nkuma vapua vatekuluila va Avilahama ndi? Kaha nange vene njimutekuilila ua Avilahama. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Nkuma vapua vangamba va Kilistu ndi? Kaha yange njapua njiuakama kuvapulakana, njilinakuhandeka ngue muntu uakuzaluka, njinapanga cikuma na kuhundangana, njinakala mu kamenga vintsimbu viavingi na kunjipupa lualuingi kutonda nakutsa. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ha vintsimbu vitanu, vanjipupile makote makumi auana kuhumisako likote limo ku vakuluntu va Vayunda. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ha vintsimbu vitatu vanjipupile na vivanzi, kaha lumo vanjashele mavue. Kaha ha vintsimbu vitatu omo njendele mu vuato, vuje vuato vunjendelelemo vuapihile, ha vutsiki na mutania njakele mu cisali. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ha mangenzi amengi, njakele mu vukalu vua vindonga, njakele muvukalu ku mihuza, njakele mu vukalu ku vantu vange vavenia, njakele mu vukalu kuli vaje keti Vayunda, njakele mu vukalu mu nganda, njakele mu vukalu mu mpambo, njakele mu vukalu ku cisali, njakele mu vukalu kuli vaka kutsiliela va makuli. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Njahundanganene na kupanga cikuma, kunjakele na kukosa ku vintsimbu viavingi, njakele mu njala na mpuila, vintsimbu viavingi cakuhona viakulia, njakele mulisika nakuhona vuzalo. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kaha ku vikuavo viekani, kuli vukalu vua ha litangua na litangua hali yange vuakushoshomua vikungulukilo vioshe. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Iya nazeye, nkuma yange kunjazeyele ndi? Iya ivauisilile mu vupi, nkuma yange kunjanienguele ndi?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Kaha nga njilihalesa njikalihalesa ha viuma vije vimuesa kuzeya cange. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Njambi na Tate ya Muene Yesu, uje ikeye uakukuisula vintsimbu vioshe nazivuka nguendi kunjekukuisa. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ku Ndamasika nguvulu uje uakele muintsi lia Muene Aletasa uaniungile nganda ya Ndamasika linga vanjikute. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Vuno honi vanjisosele mu mutonga kuhitila mu njanena mu civumbe, kaha njovokele ku mavoko endi.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Vimona na visholola via Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Njapande kulihalesa cipue vene nacimo cahi cinjasa kuuanaho, vuno honi njitualelelaho na vimona na visholola via Muene. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Njazivuka yala umo muli Kilistu uje ha miaka makumi auana laja vamutualele ku lilu lia mucitatu, yanini honi indi capuile ku muvila indi keti ku muvila kunjizivuka, Njambi lika ikeye azivuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Kaha njazivuka ngeci yala ou vamutualele mu Palandaisi, yanini honi indi ku muvila cipue keti ku muvila kunjizivuka, Njambi lika ikeye azivuka. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Kaha njovuile viuma vije kuvasa kuviambulula, vije muntu kasa kuhandeka. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Hakuimanenako ou yala njilihalesa, vuno honi hakulimanena yange vavenia kunjikalihalesa, kuvanga lika via kuzeya cange. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kaha cipue vene nga njitonda kulihalesa, kunjikapu njicilema, muomu njikahandeka vusunga. Vuno honi kunjitondo kucilinga, linga keti muntu umo asinganieke cikuma hali yange kupulakana vije viamona muli yange cipue vievua kuli yange.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Kaha hakulinga yange keti njilihalese cikuma na vuingi vua visholola, ngeci vanjihakele mbimbo mu muvila, linga kanganda ua satana anjipakese, ngeci keti njilihalese cikuma. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Njalambelele Muene ha vintsimbu vitatu hali eci, linga cinjiseze. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Vuno honi uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Kavumbi kange kanapu kakama hali yove, muomu nzili yange yapua ya vusunga mukuzeya.” Kaha njikavuahelela cikuma nakulihalesa ha kuzeya cange linga nzili ya Kilistu ihuimine hali yange. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Muomu ya Kilistu, njapuisamo na kuzeya, na vituka, na kuhundangana, na mapakeso na lamba, muomu nga njinazeye, ambahoni njikolesa.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushota mutima ca Paulu hali vaka Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Njilinakulinga ngue njicilema, muanjisindiiye linga njifuemo, muomu yeni muanjitavesele. Muomu kunjapuile njiuamundende kuli vaje valitumbula vavenia nguavo tunganda vakama, cipue vene yange nji muntu lika. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Vimueso via kanganda ua vusunga va vilingile hakati keni mukusimpa coshe, na vimueso na vikomoueso na vipangi via kuhiana <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Nkuma vamikehesele vati hakati ka vikungulukilo vieka, oku yange kunjapuile citeli kuli yeni? Njikonekeleni ku kupihisa eci!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Honi njalivuahesela vualumo mukumimeneka ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu. Kaha kunjikapu citeli, muomu kunjitondo vije vinapu vieni vuno honi yeni, muomu vana kuvapandele kuniunga visemi vavo, vuno honi visemi kuniunga vana vavo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Njikavuahelela cikuma kuhana na kunjihana muomu ya miono yeni. Nga yange njimizanga cikuma, kaha nkuma yange cinapande kunjizanga kavundende ndi?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Taveni ngeci yange kunjapuile citeli kuli yeni, vuno honi mukahandeka ngueni njapuile muka kuzangama na kumikuisa na makuli. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Nkuma njamizangamenene kuhitila muli vaje njatumine kuli yeni ndi? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Njalambelele Tito linga eje kuli yeni kaha njamutumine hamo na muanetu. Nkuma Tito uamizangamenene ndi? Nkuma kutualingile vilinga via cimbembesi umo lika ndi? Nkuma kutuendele mumolika ndi? <verse eid="2CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Nkuma vintsimbu vioshe muka singanieka ngueni tukaliluila yetu vavenia kuli yeni ndi? Ku mesho a Njambi kukeko kutuli nakuhandeka muli Kilistu, kaha vioshe evi vinapu viakutunga ceni vamuanetu. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Muomu njiteua nguange omo njikeja kaha njikamiuana muje kunjatondele, kaha naua nange mukanjiuana muje kumuatondele. Kaha kukakala kulicokota, na lifuua, na vutenu, na cipululu, na kuli zanga yeni vavenia, na kulishaula, na kulifueya, na kulihalesa, katumamesi kakuhona kuyilamo. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Njili na kuteua ngeci omo njikeja naua Njambi yange hamo akanjikehesa ku mesho eni, kaha hamo njikalila muomu ya vantu vavengi vaje valingile vupi laja kaha kuvatengulukile ku kulijualesa, na kuvupangala na ku vilinga via kuteuesa vije vivalingile.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Vishika viakumanusuila na vihindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Eyi inapu ntsimbu ya mucitatu ije njija kuli yeni. Mulonga uoshe uapande kukala na vakaleho vavali cipue vatatu. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Njananguile vaje valingile vupi ha kulivanga na vaje vakuavo voshe, kaha njivanangula hano oku njiuahiko, ngue muje munjalingile oku tele kunjili ha vungenzi vuange vua mucivali, ngeci nga njija naua kaha kunjikavovola, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />muomu mutonda cimueso ngeci Kilistu ali nakuhandeka muli yange. Kapuile uakuzeya linga amihonoue, vuno honi uapua uanzili muli yeni. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Muomu vamushukikile mukuzeya, vuno honi uayoya ha nzili ya Njambi. Muomu tuapua vakuzeya muli ikeye, vuno honi mu vusamba neni tukayoya hamo nendi ha nzili ya Njambi.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Lihiluleni yeni vavenia, linga mumone indi hanga muakakateya ku lutsilielo lueni. Liesekeni yeni vavenia. Nkuma kumuazivukile ngueni Yesu Kilistu ali muli yeni ndi? Kuvanga mulihilule keti ngoconi cilivene kaha munahonoua ceseko! <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Njitsiliela nguange mukauana ngueni kutuahonouele. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Vuno honi tulomba kuli Njambi ngeci keti mulinge viavipi, keti cisholoke ngue yetu tunasa eci ceseko, vuno honi linga mulinge vije via kusungama, cipue vene oku cimuesa ngeci tunahonoua. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Muomu kutuasa kulinga vioshe hakuluisa vusunga, vuno honi vioshe lika muomu ya vusunga. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Muomu tuna vuahelela ngeci yetu tunapu vakuzeya kaha yeni muvakukolesa. Yetu tuli nakulomba lika mutualeleleho lutue. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Njilinakusoneka eci oku kunjesi hamo neni, linga ngeci omo njija keti cikanjikaluuile mukupangesa nzili yakama ije Muene nanjihana yakutunga kaha keti yakushandola.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Cakumanusuila, vamuanetu, saleniho. Kakateyeni kulinga viuma via kulumbunuka, ivuilileni kukulambelela cange, litavasaneni umo na mukuavo, yoyeni mu ciyulo. Kaha Njambi ua cizango na ciyulo akakala neni.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Lihinduiseni umo na mukuavo na kulitsemba ca kulela.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Vantu voshe vakulela va Njambi vanatumu vihindu kuli yeni.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Kavumbi ka Muene Yesu Kilistu na cizango ca Njambi na kulitombola ca Cimbembesi Uakulela vikale neni voshe.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>